              "items": [
                {
                  "text": "Mal 3:14",
                  "type": "text"
                }
              ]
            },
            {
              "text": ".",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " Kandi nimugira muti: Ebi ka byaturusya! kandi nimubyeshaanya; nikwo MUKAMA ow'amahe arikugira. Nimureeta ekinyagirwe n'amaani, nari ekiremaire, nari ekirwaire, ngu ebyo ga mukireetsire kukihonga; nikwo MUKAMA ow'amahe arikugira. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "MAL.1.13",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "MAL.1.13"
            ]
          }
        },
